# === PRODUCT PDFs (SELLABLE — never push to GitHub) ===
# The PDFs are the product we sell; they live on local disk only.
# Source (markdown issues, AU pages, scripts) is pushed; PDFs are regenerable
# via build_calendar.py / multiverse.py and must NOT be committed.
ponderables/pdf/
pdf/
*.pdf

